  IDPhoto: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 818bfa774dbdf4740b77f7dbbba112e1, type: 3}
  CharacterPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  entryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Returning to my apartment on the residential block.
    - I live here. I am going home.
    - A resident returning before the evening bell.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Returning home. I have been out since morning.
    - Going back to my flat. I have everything I need.
    - I live in the building at the end of the street. That is all.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Going home for the lockdown period. As instructed.
    - I am a registered resident. This is my address.
    - Returning to my registered residence. I have my papers.
  invalidEntryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - I am going to meet my florist. She has my bouquet ready.
    - There is a ceremony on the eastern side. I am expected.
    - I need to pick up the centrepieces from the hall.
    midDaysReasons:
    - The venue is past the checkpoint. I will not be long.
    - Someone is waiting for me on the other side. It is important.
    - I have to check the flowers before the ceremony. They need water.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - The church is just past the wire. It will not take a moment.
    - I made a promise. It is beyond the checkpoint. I need to keep it.
    - Someone left something behind the perimeter. I am the only one who knows where
      it is.
  entryDialogues:
    lastVerdict: 0
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Here. My documents. Could we be quick? I have somewhere to be.
    - Good morning. I keep my papers in the flowers. I forgot, I do not have flowers
      today.
    - I am a resident. I have been a resident for four years. The dress is for later.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - My documents. Here. The dress is for a fitting. They asked me to wear it in.
    - I know how this works. I come through every day. You can check your list.
    - Here. Thank you. I am going home. I am not sure when the ceremony is. Soon,
      I think.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - I have my papers. I have always had my papers. The dress is for the wedding.
      It is soon.
    - I know you. You have been here before. We have met. You waved at me once.
    - I do not need much time. I know the questions. I will answer the ones I can.
